Definition auxv_list (x3 x4 x5 x16 x6 x11 x12 x23 rnd : Z) : list word :=
  map wz [3; x3; 4; x4; 5; x5; 16; x16; 6; x6; 11; x11; 12; x12; 23; x23; 25; rnd; 0; 0].

